        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bamwi bana ba-Manase muziinga zyabo mbaaba:— bana ba-Abiezezi abana baHeleki abana ba-Asrieli abana ba-Sekemu abana ba-Heferi abana ba-Semida. Mbaaba bana baalumi ba-Manase mwana wa-Josefa muziinga zyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
