            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bana ba-Josefa bakabuzya Joshua kuti, Ino nkaambonzi watupa caabilo comwe buyo acisi comwe buyo? Tuli banji, nkaambo kuzwa kumatalikilo akusikila sunu Jehova watupa coolwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Joshua wakabaambila kuti, Na muli bantu banji, kamuya kutusakasaka, akulianzila busena nkuko mucisi caba-Perizi aba-Refai na mwaata mucilundu ca-Efraimu. ",
