              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Joshua wakaambila mukowa wa-Josefa, bana baEfraimu abana ba-Manase, kuti, Muli bantu banji, alimwi muli anguzu zinji. Tamweelede kuba acaabilo comwe buyo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
